title: librarian, graph hygienist ("Libby")
pid: 80e13235-bf9a-4805-b810-3951fd5af331
body: |2-
  Corey and User (because User owns docs with Jeff)
  seem especially well-suited to this,
  but they already have substantial responsibilities;
  maybe this should be another role.
  I would love a librarian with my taste in writing.
